  "steps": [
   "Heat 1 tbsp of the oil in a large frying pan over a medium heat. Add the fennel and fennel seeds and cook for 5 minutes, stirring, until soft. Tip into a mixing bowl.",
   "Add the beans and mash roughly. Stir in the walnuts, feta, egg, breadcrumbs, half the dill, the zest of the lemon, the salt and some pepper. Shape into 8 patties.",
   "Wipe the pan, heat 2 tbsp of the oil over a medium heat and fry the patties for 4 to 5 minutes on each side, until golden and crisp. Cook them in two batches if your pan is small.",
   "Meanwhile, stir the rest of the dill and a squeeze of lemon into the yoghurt. Lay the tomatoes on a plate, drizzle with the last of the oil and season.",
